(SOCIOLOGICAL PRINCIPLES:) Tj
0 -11 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(1. No Caste System: Tangkhul society is strictly non-caste, egalitarian and democratic.) Tj
0 -10 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(2. Patrilineal Clans \(Shang / Shangnao\): Lineage identity passes unbroken down the male descent.) Tj
0 -10 Td
/F1 8 Tf
(3. Strict Clan Exogamy: Intra-clan marriage is prohibited \(Masi-kongra\); unions unite separate clans.) Tj
0 -10 Td
/F1 8 Tf
